OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA damp end
OL,6,Fto the day for many with some heavy
OL,7,Frain over higher ground early this
OL,8,Fevening. Turning generally drier
OL,9,Fovernight, but further showery rain is
OL,10,Fpossible later, mainly over the hills.
OL,11,FWindy and much milder than last night.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FA rather windy day but often
OL,14,Fdry with sunny spells. A few blustery
OL,15,Fshowers are possible, mainly in the
OL,16,Fnorth. Feeling warm in the sunshine
OL,17,Fand out of the wind.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
