OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FSunny
OL,6,Fspells and lighter winds on Sunday.
OL,7,FCloudier early next week with
OL,8,Foccasional rain, mainly on Monday and
OL,9,Facross Cumbria. Staying largely dry
OL,10,Felsewhere with some warm sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
